  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a47ea16850adaec",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 3n 在 Google I/O 期间以预览版的形式发布。端侧社区对此非常兴奋，因为这款模型从设计之初就是为了在你的硬件上本地运行。不仅如此，它还原生支持多模态，能够接受图像、文本、音频和视频输入 🤯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e5a4aa1690f8703",
      "translationZh": "今天，Gemma 3n 终于可以通过最常用的开源库使用了。其中包括 transformers & timm、MLX、llama.cpp（文本输入）、transformers.js、ollama、Google AI Edge 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e1a09d7f40dbe91",
      "translationZh": "这篇文章将快速介绍一些实用片段，演示如何通过这些库使用该模型，以及针对其他领域对它进行微调有多么容易。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5fc61bc3e7837325",
      "translationZh": "今天发布的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "498e56737caef388",
      "translationZh": "这里是 Gemma 3n 发布合集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b4cdcd8af083142",
      "translationZh": "今天发布了两种规模的模型，每种都有两个变体（基础版和指令版）。模型名称采用了非标准的命名方式：它们分别叫作 gemma-3n-E2B 和 gemma-3n-E4B。参数量前面的 E 代表 Effective（有效）。它们的实际参数量分别为 5B 和 8B，但由于内存效率的提升，它们在 VRAM（GPU 显存）中只需要容纳相当于 2B 和 4B 参数的部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c522aff6689e3c95",
      "translationZh": "因此，就硬件支持而言，这些模型表现得像 2B 和 4B 模型，但在质量上却超出了 2B/4B 模型的水平。E2B 模型仅需 2GB GPU 显存即可运行，而 E4B 只需 3GB GPU 显存即可运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1af851907331c0ed",
      "translationZh": "规模",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b47361aad19bb48",
      "translationZh": "基础版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e42aa4dcd536041",
      "translationZh": "指令版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bf0276149e4aaa2d",
      "translationZh": "模型详情",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "640d3ce7e9504dd6",
      "translationZh": "除了语言解码器，Gemma 3n 还使用了音频编码器和视觉编码器。下面我们将重点介绍它们的主要特性，并说明它们是如何被加入 transformers 和 timm 的，因为这两个库中的实现是其他实现的参考。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6828e6d7aa04e075",
      "translationZh": "视觉编码器（MobileNet-V5）。Gemma 3n 使用了 MobileNet 的新版本：MobileNet-v5-300，它已被加入今天发布的新版 timm。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed98074bc4b81bde",
      "translationZh": "拥有 300M 参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b6035daef84f106c",
      "translationZh": "支持 256x256、512x512 和 768x768 的分辨率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95986071158f3ed9",
      "translationZh": "在 Google Pixel 上达到 60 FPS，性能优于 ViT Giant，而参数量仅为其 1/3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b67de12530f1ca1",
      "translationZh": "音频编码器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "58ea0ddd636756ff",
      "translationZh": "基于 Universal Speech Model（USM）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12246d4fb6033666",
      "translationZh": "以 160ms 的分块处理音频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a7bd86861b729ec8",
      "translationZh": "支持语音转文本和翻译功能（例如，从英语翻译为西班牙语或法语）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce70371f8ce7f847",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 3n 架构与语言模型。该架构本身已加入今天发布的新版 transformers。此实现调用 timm 进行图像编码，因此 MobileNet 架构只有一个参考实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "86ff7050f653b9de",
      "translationZh": "架构亮点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f890651d960f7eb",
      "translationZh": "MatFormer 架构：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ab1b72c5e064106",
      "translationZh": "一种类似于套娃嵌入的嵌套式 transformer 设计，允许提取不同的层子集，就像它们是独立模型一样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2cb003777e090ac4",
      "translationZh": "E2B 和 E4B 一起训练，其中 E2B 被配置为 E4B 的子模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de4cb52b599a9601",
      "translationZh": "用户可以根据自己的硬件特性和内存预算，对各层进行“混搭”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af69a2748556fd05",
      "translationZh": "逐层嵌入（PLE）：通过将嵌入卸载到 CPU 来减少加速器内存占用。这就是为什么 E2B 模型虽然实际拥有 5B 参数，但其 GPU 内存占用却与 2B 参数模型大致相当。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec40a31080c894f7",
      "translationZh": "KV 缓存共享：加速音频和视频的长上下文处理，预填充速度达到 Gemma 3 4B 的 2 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "218f700faea0fc60",
      "translationZh": "性能与基准测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a88e837c46a05ee5",
      "translationZh": "LMArena 得分：E4B 是首个获得 1300+ 分的参数量低于 10B 的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37f921dd6ee5daf2",
      "translationZh": "MMLU 得分：Gemma 3n 在不同规模（E4B、E2B 以及多种 Mix-n-Match 配置）下均表现出具有竞争力的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c54f4b2118ecc40c",
      "translationZh": "多语言支持：文本支持 140 种语言，多模态交互支持 35 种语言。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6770f946af613d52",
      "translationZh": "演示空间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0f0de1160718d9b",
      "translationZh": "想直观感受一下模型表现，最简单的方法就是使用该模型专属的 Hugging Face Space。你可以在这里尝试不同的提示词和不同的模态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c99dd09c6ffcb88",
      "translationZh": "📱 空间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aa7914bb4c4c4f67",
      "translationZh": "使用 transformers 进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b803698811c8b7d",
      "translationZh": "安装最新版本的 timm（用于视觉编码器）和 transformers，以运行推理或对模型进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dc25c5d9e6ad19c5",
      "translationZh": "使用 pipeline 进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8ccd8945c55e3cd",
      "translationZh": "开始使用 Gemma 3n 最简单的方式是使用 transformers 中的 pipeline 抽象：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457f4957af842a52",
      "translationZh": "输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ca8a086a0803f04b",
      "translationZh": "使用 transformers 进行推理的详细步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c0635a7be760ec8",
      "translationZh": "从 Hub 初始化模型和处理器，并编写 model_generation 函数，负责处理提示词并在模型上运行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "807d807d52340e5d",
      "translationZh": "由于该模型支持将所有模态作为输入，下面简要说明如何通过 transformers 在代码中使用这些模态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8bbfc646f3f5d9c2",
      "translationZh": "仅文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457f4957af842a52",
      "translationZh": "输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8ee84b1421921ea5",
      "translationZh": "与音频交错",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457f4957af842a52",
      "translationZh": "输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9596ff8804ca8a8f",
      "translationZh": "与图像/视频交错",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc7116ee9a01fe8f",
      "translationZh": "对视频的支持是通过将其作为一组图像帧来实现的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457f4957af842a52",
      "translationZh": "输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5e0e44aad963d5a3",
      "translationZh": "使用 MLX 进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3757187c218fb57",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 3n 在发布首日就已通过 MLX 支持全部 3 种模态。请务必升级你安装的 mlx-vlm。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce19a2525d844c3b",
      "translationZh": "从视觉功能开始：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff9e7a644ea1d1ff",
      "translationZh": "以及音频功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "573132ecefc8fdde",
      "translationZh": "使用 llama.cpp 进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46f07f5ad21a1578",
      "translationZh": "除了 MLX，Gemma 3n（仅限文本）也可以在 llama.cpp 中开箱即用。请务必从源码安装 llama.cpp/ Ollama。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a16e8622d06686af",
      "translationZh": "请在此处查看 llama.cpp 的安装说明：https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/docs/install.md",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fcedd67416cc3f3",
      "translationZh": "你可以按以下方式运行它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "42a56450f8939903",
      "translationZh": "使用 Transformers.js 和 ONNXRuntime 进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d844c6cab981f793",
      "translationZh": "最后，我们还发布了 gemma-3n-E2B-it 模型变体的 ONNX 权重，支持在各种运行时和平台上灵活部署。对于 JavaScript 开发者，Gemma3n 已集成到 Transformers.js 中，从 3.6.0 版本起即可使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d655772469cdfdd9",
      "translationZh": "有关如何使用这些库运行模型的更多信息，请查看模型卡中的使用说明部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "71b3b0dfa8ae464f",
      "translationZh": "在免费的 Google Colab 中进行微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdfa756158ce1d9c",
      "translationZh": "考虑到模型的大小，针对不同模态的特定下游任务对其进行微调相当方便。为了让你更轻松地微调模型，我们创建了一个简单的笔记本，让你可以在免费的 Google Colab 上进行实验！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a551340b39d8a8b",
      "translationZh": "我们还提供了一个专门用于音频任务微调的笔记本，让你可以轻松地使模型适配你的语音数据集和基准测试！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5264225fe237605e",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Gemma 实践配方",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1d70d1eb7391299",
      "translationZh": "随着此次发布，我们还推出了 Hugging Face Gemma Recipes 仓库。你可以在其中找到用于运行模型和对模型进行微调的笔记本及脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23874c31a9e06f3b",
      "translationZh": "我们非常希望你使用 Gemma 系列模型，并为它添加更多实践方案！欢迎在仓库中提交 Issues 和创建 Pull Requests。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea7e77b189a19f9e",
      "translationZh": "我们始终很高兴能托管 Google 及其 Gemma 系列模型。我们希望社区能够携手合作，充分发挥这些模型的价值。多模态、体积小、能力强，共同成就了一次出色的模型发布！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a707cdb68969d63d",
      "translationZh": "如果你想更详细地讨论这些模型，欢迎直接在这篇博文下方发起讨论。我们非常乐意提供帮助！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b64a779fe0004a94",
      "translationZh": "衷心感谢 Arthur、Cyril、Raushan、Lysandre，以及 Hugging Face 所有负责集成工作并让社区能够使用这些模型的成员！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "on-device",
      "briefZh": "端侧",
      "explanationZh": "指在用户设备上本地运行模型，而非依赖远程服务器。"
    },
    {
      "term": "natively multimodal",
      "briefZh": "原生多模态",
      "explanationZh": "指模型本身就支持处理多种类型的输入，此处包括图像、文本、音频和视频。"
    },
    {
      "term": "fine-tune",
      "briefZh": "微调",
      "explanationZh": "在已有模型的基础上继续训练，使其适应特定领域或任务。"
    },
    {
      "term": "base and instruct",
      "briefZh": "基础版与指令版",
      "explanationZh": "指基础模型变体和经过指令训练、用于响应用户指令的模型变体。"
    },
    {
      "term": "parameter count",
      "briefZh": "参数量",
      "explanationZh": "模型所包含的参数数量；文中区分了实际参数量与显存中所需的有效参数量。"
    },
    {
      "term": "VRAM",
      "briefZh": "显存",
      "explanationZh": "GPU 使用的内存，用于存放模型参数等运行所需的数据。"
    },
    {
      "term": "memory efficiency",
      "briefZh": "内存效率",
      "explanationZh": "指模型利用内存的效率；效率提升可降低运行时所需的内存容量。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Base",
      "briefZh": "基础版",
      "explanationZh": "指模型的基础版本，与经过指令微调的版本相区分。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Instruct",
      "briefZh": "指令版",
      "explanationZh": "指经过指令微调、用于理解和遵循用户指令的模型版本。"
    },
    {
      "term": "language decoder",
      "briefZh": "语言解码器",
      "explanationZh": "负责生成语言输出的模型组件。"
    },
    {
      "term": "audio encoder",
      "briefZh": "音频编码器",
      "explanationZh": "将音频输入转换为模型可处理的特征表示的组件。"
    },
    {
      "term": "vision encoder",
      "briefZh": "视觉编码器",
      "explanationZh": "将图像输入转换为模型可处理的特征表示的组件。"
    },
    {
      "term": "parameters",
      "briefZh": "参数",
      "explanationZh": "模型内部用于计算的数值权重，参数量是衡量模型规模的指标之一。"
    },
    {
      "term": "resolutions",
      "briefZh": "分辨率",
      "explanationZh": "此处指视觉编码器支持的输入图像像素尺寸。"
    },
    {
      "term": "FPS",
      "briefZh": "每秒帧数",
      "explanationZh": "每秒处理的图像帧数，此处用于衡量模型在设备上的处理速度。"
    },
    {
      "term": "speech-to-text",
      "briefZh": "语音转文本",
      "explanationZh": "将音频中的语音转换为文字的功能。"
    },
    {
      "term": "image encoding",
      "briefZh": "图像编码",
      "explanationZh": "将图像转换为模型可处理的特征表示。"
    },
    {
      "term": "reference implementation",
      "briefZh": "参考实现",
      "explanationZh": "供其他实现参照的架构实现；此处指统一使用的 MobileNet 实现。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Matryoshka embeddings",
      "briefZh": "套娃嵌入",
      "explanationZh": "具有嵌套结构的嵌入表示，文中用它类比可提取层子集的模型设计。"
    },
    {
      "term": "sub-model",
      "briefZh": "子模型",
      "explanationZh": "包含在更大模型中的较小模型，此处指 E4B 中的 E2B。"
    },
    {
      "term": "memory budget",
      "briefZh": "内存预算",
      "explanationZh": "可供模型使用的内存容量限制，用于决定如何组合模型层。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Per-Layer Embeddings",
      "briefZh": "逐层嵌入",
      "explanationZh": "按模型层组织的嵌入；文中通过将其卸载到 CPU 来降低加速器内存占用。"
    },
    {
      "term": "KV Cache Sharing",
      "briefZh": "KV 缓存共享",
      "explanationZh": "共享注意力机制中的键值缓存，以加速长上下文处理。"
    },
    {
      "term": "prefill",
      "briefZh": "预填充",
      "explanationZh": "模型处理输入上下文、为后续生成建立缓存的阶段。"
    }
  ],
